{"RukuNumber":283,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":76,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَنُوحًا إِذۡ نَادَىٰ مِن قَبۡلُ فَٱسۡتَجَبۡنَا لَهُۥ فَنَجَّيۡنَٰهُ وَأَهۡلَهُۥ مِنَ ٱلۡكَرۡبِ ٱلۡعَظِيمِ","TajweedText":"وَنُوحًا إِذْ نَادَىٰ مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ق</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>لُ فَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>سْتَجَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>نَا لَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> فَنَجَّيْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُ وَأَهْلَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْكَرْبِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْعَظ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مِ <span class=end>٧٦</span>","End":"٧٦","PageNumber":328,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":283,"MaqraNumber":131,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":77,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَنَصَرۡنَٰهُ مِنَ ٱلۡقَوۡمِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَذَّبُواْ بِـَٔايَٰتِنَآۚ إِنَّهُمۡ كَانُواْ قَوۡمَ سَوۡءٖ فَأَغۡرَقۡنَٰهُمۡ أَجۡمَعِينَ","TajweedText":"وَنَصَرْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُ مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْقَوْمِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ كَذَّبُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> بِـَٔـايَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تِن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ‌ۚ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُمْ كَانُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> قَوْمَ سَوْ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ءٍ ف</tajweed>َأَغْرَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>نَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُمْ أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>مَع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧٧</span>","End":"٧٧","PageNumber":328,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":283,"MaqraNumber":131,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":78,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBism